    "summary": "Errata rewriting [Veil of Darkness](vsdata:ability/necrons.awakened-dynasty.veil-of-darkness) (Awakened Dynasty). Your army may use it once per battle, as your opponent's turn ends, if the bearer's unit is **unengaged**:\n\n- The unit goes into **strategic reserves**.\n- It has **[Deep Strike](vsdata:core-ability/deep-strike)** until your next Shooting phase starts.\n- It has to arrive by **ingress move** during your next Movement phase, your first turn included.",
